WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.777
Hello there, my friend!

2
00:00:01.777 --> 00:00:03.555
I'm Ruby Rabbit.

3
00:00:03.555 --> 00:00:06.361
Today we learn about shapes everywhere!

4
00:00:07.482 --> 00:00:08.640
Are you ready?

5
00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:10.529
Let's find out together!

6
00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:12.661
Look!

7
00:00:12.661 --> 00:00:14.147
This is CIRCLE.

8
00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:17.688
A circle is perfectly round, like a wheel!

9
00:00:19.202 --> 00:00:20.874
Which one is CIRCLE?

10
00:00:25.078 --> 00:00:29.222
Remember: A circle is perfectly round, like a wheel!

11
00:00:30.526 --> 00:00:31.378
Look!

12
00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:32.892
This is SQUARE.

13
00:00:32.892 --> 00:00:36.239
A square has four sides, all the same size!

14
00:00:37.758 --> 00:00:39.652
Can you say SQUARE with me?

15
00:00:39.652 --> 00:00:40.805
Let's try!

16
00:00:45.026 --> 00:00:45.795
Look!

17
00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:47.503
This is TRIANGLE.

18
00:00:47.503 --> 00:00:51.003
A triangle has three sides and three corners!

19
00:00:52.522 --> 00:00:54.402
Which one is TRIANGLE?

20
00:00:58.614 --> 00:01:03.133
Remember: A triangle has three sides and three corners!

21
00:01:04.446 --> 00:01:05.326
Wow!

22
00:01:05.326 --> 00:01:07.340
You learned so much today.

23
00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:09.118
I am so proud of you!

24
00:01:10.322 --> 00:01:12.063
Great job, my friend!

25
00:01:12.063 --> 00:01:14.494
Come back soon and we'll learn more.

26
00:01:14.494 --> 00:01:15.522
Bye bye!

27
00:01:16.526 --> 00:01:19.253
Try "Colors All Around Us" next!
